@startuml patch-manager-admin-account-pk
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title PATCH /api/manager/v1/admin-account/{pk}
caption CRB-35 · 어드민 권한 변경 (superadmin 전용, 자기 자신은 불가)

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard\n+ SuperAdminGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "AdminAccountController" as Controller
participant "AdminAccountService" as Service
participant "AdminAccountRepository" as AdminAccountRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: PATCH /api/manager/v1/admin-account/{pk}\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>\n{ role }
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard + SuperAdminGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found\n403 Superadmin privilege is required.
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt pk가 UUID가 아님, role이 admin · superadmin이 아님
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (ParseUUIDPipe · class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: updateRole(pk, req, manager)
Controller -> Service: updateRole(pk, req, manager)
Service -> AdminAccountRepository: findByPk(pk)
AdminAccountRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT admin_account WHERE pk = ?
PostgreSQL --> AdminAccountRepository: row
alt 계정 없음
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Admin account not found.
end
alt 대상이 나 자신
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 403 You cannot change your own role.
end
note right of Service: 호출자가 superadmin으로 남으므로 superadmin이 0명이 되지 않음
Service -> AdminAccountRepository: updateRole(pk, role)
AdminAccountRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE admin_account SET role, updated_at WHERE pk = ? RETURNING
PostgreSQL --> AdminAccountRepository: row | 0행
alt 0행 (그 사이 삭제됨)
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Admin account not found.
end
note right of Service: 대상이 가진 토큰에도 다음 요청부터 바로 반영 (ManagerGuard가 DB의 role을 읽음)
Service --> Controller: AdminAccountDto
Controller --> Client: 200 { pk, email, role, created_at, updated_at }

@enduml
